1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,170
How did engineers build

2
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:03,270
an eight-hundred-foot
concrete pier

3
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:05,850
in a valley... and put
a highway on top?

4
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,260
France's Millau
Viaduct reaches

5
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:09,960
eleven hundred
twenty-five feet

6
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,100
at its highest point.

7
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:12,980
First, engineers drilled

8
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:15,130
deep foundation
shafts into bedrock.

9
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:18,080
Then they built seven
hollow concrete piers

10
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,780
using self-climbing formwork.

11
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:21,390
Crews poured concrete,

12
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:22,930
waited for it to gain strength,

13
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:25,380
and raised the formwork
roughly thirteen feet

14
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:26,360
for the next section.

15
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:28,210
Again. And again.

16
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:30,410
But that only solved
half the problem.

17
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:33,000
The steel roadway still
had to cross the valley.

18
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:35,260
So instead of
lifting it into place,

19
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,650
crews assembled the
steel deck on land,

20
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:38,810
on both sides.

21
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Sixty-four hydraulic
translators

22
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,590
pushed those sections
forward in small steps.

23
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:46,100
Temporary red towers
and stay cables

24
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,570
supported the advancing
decks above the gaps.

25
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:50,920
After eighteen
launching operations,

26
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:53,290
the two halves met high
above the Tarn River

27
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:54,780
in May two thousand four.

28
00:00:55,010 --> 00:00:57,230
Engineers raised the
remaining steel pylons

29
00:00:57,230 --> 00:00:58,580
and tensioned the cables.

30
00:00:58,790 --> 00:01:00,800
By December, the
bridge was complete.

31
00:01:01,110 --> 00:01:02,860
They didn't build
the road in the sky.

32
00:01:03,110 --> 00:01:04,300
They pushed it there.
